idth="270" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="10" color="rgb(217,150,46)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="1" bold="true"><p>TRUST LAYER · 三道关</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="636" topLeftY="148" width="270" height="86" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(232,240,246)"/></fill></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="636" topLeftY="148" width="4" height="86" presetHandlers="2"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(74,127,165)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="652" topLeftY="160" width="240" height="18"><content textType="body" fontSize="13" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>输出分级</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="652" topLeftY="184" width="242" height="44"><content textType="body" fontSize="10.5" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>裁决结果分 A–E 五级，正确、错误、存疑区别对待，不做单点阈值</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="636" topLeftY="244" width="270" height="86" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(233,242,240)"/></fill></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="636" topLeftY="244" width="4" height="86" presetHandlers="2"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(111,163,155)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="652" topLeftY="256" width="240" height="18"><content textType="body" fontSize="13" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>回填门控</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="652" topLeftY="280" width="242" height="44"><content textType="body" fontSize="10.5" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>全票 · 聚合 · 可撤销 · 独立验证四重门控，全过才写入记忆</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="636" topLeftY="340" width="270" height="86" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(250,240,224)"/></fill></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="636" topLeftY="340" width="4" height="86" presetHandlers="2"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(217,150,46)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="652" topLeftY="352" width="240" height="18"><content textType="body" fontSize="13" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>复核兜底</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="652" topLeftY="376" width="242" height="44"><content textType="body" fontSize="10.5" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>抑制池压制已知误报；无候选分支抽样与全量复核双保险</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="636" topLeftY="436" width="270" height="58" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(31,46,56)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="652" topLeftY="445" width="240" height="14"><content textType="body" fontSize="9.5" color="rgb(150,166,178)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>误报率 FPR（87 合成集实测）</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="652" topLeftY="461" width="244" height="28"><content textType="body" fontSize="14" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top">['<p><span color="rgb(217,150,46)" bold="true" fontSize="17" fontFamily="Roboto Mono">0.154 → 0.0435</span><span color="rgb(255,255,255)" bold="true" fontSize="12" fontFamily="Roboto Mono">  -72%</span></p>']</content></shape></data><note><content textType="body" fontSize="12"><p>信任层是架构的 2.5 代升级。裁决结果先分 A 到 E 五级；只有 A、B 类且通过四重门控才允许回填记忆库；已知误报进抑制池，无候选分支还有抽样和全量复核兜底。实测效果：在 87 段合成集上，纯 LLM 误报率 0.154，信任层压到 0.0435，降幅 72%，而且这一切都有门控记录、可以回滚。</p></content></note></slide>